From dee5e5d38f88d588aea1b44cc3e5e66caea11625 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Majid Arasskhani <M.Arasskhani@gosilkroad.net>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:37:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] refactor(budget): drop the unused per-operation hold
 estimators and their env keys

`estimate_chat/embedding/image/video/metered_service/speech_hold` and
`_clamp_hold` have had no production caller since `reservation_hold_usd`
(pricing-snapshot based) replaced them; the six
`BUDGET_*_FALLBACK_HOLD_USD` settings were read only by those functions,
so a value in `.env` changed nothing. Removed with the one test that
exercised the dead path. `budget_max_hold_usd`, `budget_unpriced_hold_usd`
and `budget_hold_buffer` are still live and untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UTnpHajSmkk2JMLfuQoV7o
